WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.680
Episode 93

2
00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:06.380
Three years ago,

3
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.020
I waited for you to return from Elveron

4
00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:09.460
to Sapphire Street

5
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:10.620
to put a real ring

6
00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:11.580
on my finger.

7
00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:13.980
This time,

8
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.460
it's your turn to wait for me.

9
00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:19.100
Wait for me to return from abroad

10
00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:20.580
and put

11
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:21.420
this real ring on for me.

12
00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:21.940
Is that okay?

13
00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:24.460
Okay.

14
00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:29.460
Three months later.

15
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.380
Mom,

16
00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:37.140
you have just recovered.

17
00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:37.940
Let me handle things like

18
00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:38.660
carrying the luggage.

19
00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:39.580
You silly girl,

20
00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:41.060
I'm not that fragile.

21
00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:41.620
Noemi,

22
00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:42.900
shouldn't we

23
00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:43.940
tell Mr. Bradley

24
00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:45.020
about our return?

25
00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:45.660
No need.

26
00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:46.740
Once everything is resolved,

27
00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:48.220
I want to give him a surprise.

28
00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:52.620
So, should we

29
00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:53.820
go to the hotel now or...

30
00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:55.460
Let's go to the Curtis family first.

31
00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:58.020
There are some matters

32
00:00:58.040 --> 00:00:59.420
that need to be settled.

33
00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:04.460
Although my daughter

34
00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:06.260
is not married to the Bradley family yet,

35
00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:07.140
Niko

36
00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:09.300
has deep feelings for my daughter.

37
00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:11.580
They will remarry sooner or later.

38
00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:13.360
The Curtis family and the Bradley family

39
00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:15.060
are already one family.

40
00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:16.420
As long as

41
00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:18.260
you provide me with enough benefits,

42
00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:20.600
it will be a piece of cake for you

43
00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:22.060
to work with the Bradley family.

44
00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:25.180
That's right.

45
00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:26.620
You are using

46
00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:28.180
my relationship with the Bradley family to make
money.

47
00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:29.580
You really disgust me.

48
00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:30.020
Who's speaking?
